  data: {
    LLM: "Identify the Master cards (Unter, 6, 2) in your team immediately. Coordinate with your partner so that you don't 'clash' your high cards on the same trick.\n\nThe 'Seven' Trap: Use your Seven (The Devil) only when you are in the lead. It is your only 'free' trick-winner. If you hold it until the end, it will likely be beaten by a plain card.\n\nManaging the Plain Kings: Since the 3, 4, and 5 of trumps can only beat Kings/Obers, use them to 'kill' the opponents' high plain-suit cards so your partner's plain Kings become the master of their own suit.",
